<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady. Trading was moderately slow. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs    54.50-55.00</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-300 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $2.50. Top $54.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-400 lbs   46.00-46.50</p>
<p>		   400-450 lbs   48.00</p>
<p>		   450-550 lbs   50.00, few 52.00</p>
<p>		   550-650 lbs   53.00-54.00</p>
</text>
